        "text": "A wall of blue <strong>ice</strong> bars this tunnel. Ice never gives way: only a blast breaks it. You know the stick: its fuse burns down with <strong>every step and every second</strong>, five in all, and the blast clears the tiles right around it, never rock. Two tiles away you are safe.",
